OL,3,GNEWSAGuernsey fuel duty set to be
OL,4,Afrozen in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FFuel duty in Guernsey is set to be
OL,7,Ffrozen at its current level in 2027.
OL,9,FDeputies agreed in principle to keep
OL,10,Ftax on motor fuel at 90.5p per litre.
OL,12,FDeputy Lee Van Katwyk, who forwarded
OL,13,Fthe move, said it would save motorists
OL,14,F4p per litre at the pump - it will go
OL,15,Fto a final vote with the wider 2027
OL,16,Fbudget before it is fully approved.
OL,18,FPolicy & Resources President Lindsay de
OL,19,FSausmarez said the move would reduce
OL,20,FStates income by more than #900,000 in
OL,21,F2027.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
